{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1478787-tc-2e-astral-space-psychic-realms","id":1478787,"title":"[TC 2E] Astral Space / Psychic Realms","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-04-13T12:56:19-07:00","id":1478787,"title":"[TC 2E] Astral Space / Psychic Realms","content":"So I must say on start this...<br /> <br /> I LOVE Astral Space, Inner Minds Realms, Figments of Imaginations. What's in your mind, really. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> It was one of my favourites things in (both) <b>Mage(s) </b>RPGs or <b>Inception </b>movie.<br /> <br /> Are there powers in <b>Tinity 2E</b> to recreate Inner Minds explorations? \ud83e\udd14 If not, how would you made those powers to enter Minds of others recreated ?<br /> <br /> If you still do not know about what I ask - just see sum up of <b>Psychonauts 1</b> video game. It's all game series about those things. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JbpFSC_ikko\" data-code=\"JbpFSC_ikko\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/JbpFSC_ikko/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-13T14:42:12-07:00","id":1478794,"title":"","content":"For that sort of thing, you'll want to look at Mesmerists in TC: Adventure! who have gifts relating to illusions, dreams and astral projection, and my personal favorite : &quot;Palace of the Mind&quot;.<br /> <br /> Telepathic psiads and psions should in theory surpass them, but unless you cook up creative modes telepathy powers, Mesmerists are the best at that sort of thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26426-trianoma4evah","name":"Trianoma4Evah","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-14T03:37:42-07:00","id":1478837,"title":"","content":"Telepathy in TC don\u2019t talk much about dreams and Mindscapes (a shared \u201cvirtual reality\u201d where you interact, much like a private room in astral plane) but it\u2019s not hard to place them, and even in PU there are some illustrations giving a hint about its existence.<br /> <br /> Mindshare mode, is pretty straightforward in communication and sharing memories, but it don\u2019t talk much about how it fills to share a mind. I imagine you could play on that, any character in a network have Mindscape with the projections of each of the members (and possibly multiple personalities), mental traits, like schizophrenia, maniac depressive, etc, would make those places pretty wild in their own ways.<br /> <br /> Pshychbending mode also have some impact. While it has a lot to do with controling the target body and actions, it is about changing memories and behaviors, and so changing the way the characters interacting with each other in their mindscapes and possibly the mindscape itself, as it\u2019s not more than a collectively created imagination/memory.<br /> <br /> You can make some weird things with conditions caused by telepathy, much like in Heroes, when Parkman Sr lock Parkman Jr and Molly in a mind trap, the effect in real world is the characters are unconscious, but the way they would scape from this condition is another story itself. You can have some technology, like the one in the movie \u201cThe Cell\u201d (Jennifer Lopez, worth checking) for mindsharing without a psi user.<br /> <br /> Now, what would a Aberrant look in those mindscapes? What kind of power they would have? I think a Mega Social Nova would dominate it easily if somehow locked in one with a Psion, but not sure if they could \u201ccreate\u201d one by themselves, as it\u2019s not about commanding the brain, but the conceptual conscience, that is out of reach of Quantum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-14T11:44:25-07:00","id":1478857,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24985_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24985\" data-vbnamecard=\"24985\">Mateus Luz</a> only one question to your post - <b>What is 'PU'?</b> What is <b>Heroes</b>?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-14T11:49:35-07:00","id":1478858,"title":"","content":"PU is Prometheus Unbound, a book about the the psi orders and Psi powers.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/383468/Trinity-Continuum-Prometheus-Unbound?src=hottest_filtered\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product...ttest_filtered</a><br /> <br /> Heroes is the 2005-ish series about normal people that discover they have powers, in the example, Parkman is a police officer that discovers he can listen people thoughts, later we discover his father is a powerful telepath and Parkman learns how to grow his powers.<br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heroes_(American_TV_series)\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heroes...can_TV_series)</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Cell\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://en.wik